galaxyxr-mini-tools (4~26.10.1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Add mount_android_userdata, which mounts Android's encrypted /data on
    its own: it reads KeyMint's levels from vbmeta, maps userdata with the
    metadata encryption key and adds the file-based encryption keys.

